@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title UC11 - Portable active profile export
actor "Profile manager" as Actor
participant "Profiles controller" as UI
participant profile_bundle as Bundle
database "Profiles / active revisions" as DB
Actor -> UI : Export selected IDs / all
UI -> UI : Native session key check
UI -> Bundle : export(ids, all)
Bundle -> Bundle : Capability / selection check
Bundle -> DB : Stream active configurations
DB --> Bundle : Rule documents
Bundle --> UI : Versioned JSON bundle
UI --> Actor : Native download response
note over Bundle, DB : No profile or material writes
@enduml
